  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Grapplin_gertie.jpg\" title=\"Grapplin' Gertie\"><img alt=\"Grapplin' Gertie\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"147\" src=\"/images/Grapplin_gertie.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Grapplin_gertie.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Grapplin' Gertie</div></div></div>\n<p>Grapplin' Gertie is found in the gym off of Level 3 of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a>.  She is the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Grapple_With_Gertie\" title=\"Grapple With Gertie\">Grapple With Gertie</a> and gives the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Pumping_Irony\" title=\"Pumping Irony\">Pumping Irony</a>.\n</p><p>But -- she then reappears in <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Limitless Lower Locationals</a> of of Level 5 as a monster and the object of the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Locational_School\" title=\"Locational School\">Locational School</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
